 Internally the archive backend uses the VFS to access files. It isn't
 possible to configure the internal VFS yet which might be useful.
 
+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and SquashFS archives are skipped by default. Use
+`-l`/`--links` to include them. With this flag, each link is exposed as an
+object with the `.rclonelink` suffix whose contents are the link target.
+The archive backend does not follow symbolic links.
+
+To recreate the links when copying to a local filesystem, use `--links`
+for the copy:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:/path/to/archive.zip /path/to/destination
+```
+
 ## Archive Formats
 
 Here's a table rating common archive formats on their Cloud
